<view class="container">
  <view class="title">组合餐 · 热量计算</view>
  <view class="note">组合总热量＝实际加入的食材、主食、汤底、撒料与酱料之和。可查询热量库添加，也可手动填写。场景只帮助记录，不会自动补入配料；请确认所有实际吃到的项目。</view>
  <view class="card">
    <picker range="{{scenes}}" value="{{sceneIndex}}" bindchange="sceneChange"><view class="picker">{{scenes[sceneIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
    <input placeholder="从热量库找配料：如豆皮、麻酱、米饭" value="{{query}}" bindinput="find" />
    <view class="note">最多显示30项。来源的“1份”有固定口径，不能默认等于一勺或100g。区间值暂不参与计算。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{matches}}" wx:key="id" class="line">
      <view>{{item.brand}} · {{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="note">{{item.kcal !== null ? item.kcal : item.kcalPer100g}} kcal / {{item.kcal !== null ? item.serving : '100g'}}</view>
      <button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="importItem">加入组合</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <label>目标热量 kcal（可选）</label>
    <input type="digit" value="{{target}}" bindinput="targetInput" />
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id">
    <picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{item.categoryIndex}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="categoryIndex" bindchange="edit"><view class="picker">{{categories[item.categoryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{item.baseServing}}" class="note">来源基准份量：{{item.baseServing}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.sourceNotes}}" class="note">{{item.sourceNotes}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.needsConfirmation}}" class="note">此项来源份量不完整。只有核实实际用量与原图同份后才能按份相加；否则请换用有明确克重的数据。<switch checked="{{item.portionConfirmed}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="confirmPortion" />我已核对份量</view>
    <input placeholder="配料名称" value="{{item.name}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="name" bindinput="edit" />
    <picker range="{{bases}}" value="{{item.basisIndex}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="basisIndex" bindchange="edit"><view class="picker">标注口径：{{bases[item.basisIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
    <view class="note">切换口径会清空数值，避免混用。</view>
    <label>实际加入{{item.basisIndex === 0 ? '份数（半份填0.5）' : '克数'}}</label>
    <input type="digit" value="{{item.amount}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="amount" bindinput="edit" />
    <label>{{bases[item.basisIndex]}}的热量 kcal（未知留空）</label>
    <input type="digit" value="{{item.kcal}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="kcal" bindinput="edit" />
    <label>以下均按{{bases[item.basisIndex]}}填写，单位 g；未知留空</label>
    <input placeholder="蛋白质" type="digit" value="{{item.protein}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="protein" bindinput="edit" />
    <input placeholder="碳水" type="digit" value="{{item.carbs}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="carbs" bindinput="edit" />
    <input placeholder="脂肪" type="digit" value="{{item.fat}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="fat" bindinput="edit" />
    <input placeholder="来源或备注，如店内标签" value="{{item.source}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="source" bindinput="edit" />
    <button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除这项</button>
  </view>
  <button bindtap="add">添加配料</button>
  <button class="action" bindtap="calculate">计算当前组合</button>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{result}}">
    <view wx:if="{{result.complete}}" class="title">{{result.energyLabel}}</view>
    <view wx:else><view>已知部分：{{result.subtotals.kcal}} kcal</view><view>缺少 {{result.missingLabel}} 的热量，无法给出完整组合合计。</view></view>
    <view>{{result.comparison}}</view>
    <view class="note">蛋白质 {{result.proteinLabel}} · 碳水 {{result.carbsLabel}} · 脂肪 {{result.fatLabel}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{result.lines}}" wx:key="id" class="line">{{item.name}}：{{item.energyLabel}}<view class="note">{{item.source}}</view></view>
    <view class="note">仅为已添加配料的参考合计。不要同时添加完整成品与其已经包含的配料；仅计算酱料时结果不代表一餐。请检查酱料、撒料、默认底料是否漏填；未填营养值不等于0。手动输入结果不代表品牌官方数据。</view>
  </view>
</view>
